<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE article PUBLIC "-//NLM//DTD JATS (Z39.96) Journal Publishing DTD v1.2 20190208//EN" "JATS-publishing1.dtd">
<article xml:lang="de"
         article-type="research-article">
   <front>
      <article-meta>
         <title-group>
            <article-title>Anchor-Default-Test</article-title>
         </title-group>
      </article-meta>
   </front>
   <body>
      <sec>
         <label>1</label>
         <title>Anchor-Default</title>
         <p>Plain boxed-text ohne @position -&gt; bekommt position="anchor":</p>
         <boxed-text position="anchor">
            <p>wird anchored</p>
         </boxed-text>
         <p>Epigraph: _blocks wandelt in disp-quote um, boxed-text verschwindet -&gt; kein anchor (Beweis: Anchor-Step greift nur auf ueberlebende boxed-text):</p>
         <disp-quote content-type="epigraph">
            <p>Epigraph-Text</p>
         </disp-quote>
         <p>Parallel-Verse: _blocks re-emittiert boxed-text ohne @position -&gt; Anchor-Step setzt position="anchor" dazu (content-type + anchor):</p>
         <boxed-text content-type="parallel-verse"
                     position="anchor">
            <table-wrap content-type="parallel">
               <table>
                  <tbody>
                     <tr>
                        <td>
                           <verse-group content-type="verse-group-wrapper">
                              <verse-group content-type="stanza">
                                 <verse-line>Links</verse-line>
                              </verse-group>
                           </verse-group>
                        </td>
                        <td>
                           <verse-group content-type="verse-group-wrapper-centered">
                              <verse-group content-type="stanza">
                                 <verse-line>Rechts</verse-line>
                              </verse-group>
                           </verse-group>
                        </td>
                     </tr>
                  </tbody>
               </table>
            </table-wrap>
         </boxed-text>
         <p>Expliziter anchor: bleibt unveraendert (idempotent):</p>
         <boxed-text position="anchor">
            <p>war schon anchor</p>
         </boxed-text>
      </sec>
   </body>
</article>